{"id":69413,"date":"2025-10-01T06:52:57","date_gmt":"2025-10-01T05:52:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69413"},"modified":"2026-10-13T23:02:42","modified_gmt":"2026-10-13T22:02:42","slug":"trail-do-sarilhocantanhede","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-sarilhocantanhede\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Sarilho\/cantanhede \u2013 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Sarilho\/cantanhede \u2013 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail do Sarilho\/cantanhede \u2013 2026<\/strong> (18\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>6 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partidas a partir das <strong>09:00<\/strong> no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Marialvas<\/strong>, em <strong>Cantanhede<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 promovida pela Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Ar Livre e Aventura da Sociedade Columb\u00f3fila Cantanhedense, em parceria com o Munic\u00edpio de Cantanhede.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Os percursos exploram os trilhos agr\u00edcolas, vinhas e a floresta do Horst de Cantanhede. O programa conta com o Trail Longo K24 (24 km \u00e0s 09:00), o Mini Trail K15 (15 km \u00e0s 09:15, pontu\u00e1vel para o Circuito Distrital da ADAC) e a Caminhada de 11 km \u00e0s 09:15. As provas de trail exigem material obrigat\u00f3rio (telem\u00f3vel, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica e copo individual) e a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio, banhos, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, abastecimentos e medalha finisher.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: