margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui o Trail Longo K24 (21,00 \u20ac), o Mini Trail K15 (17,50 \u20ac, com desconto de 1,50 \u20ac para atletas federados ADAC) e a Caminhada de 11 km (12,00 \u20ac).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">\u00c9 exigido material obrigat\u00f3rio para as provas de trail?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, no K24 e K15 \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o porte de telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica e recipiente individual para l\u00edquidos (n\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos nos abastecimentos).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio no Pavilh\u00e3o Marialvas, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial e pr\u00e9mio\/medalha finisher.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><scrip